# A Web Awesome kit for THIS project only. You almost certainly do not need it.
#
# **Projects inherit the master Docket's kit automatically.** Leave this file as
# `.example` and nothing else is required — every Docket surface here will load
# components from the same kit as every other project on this machine, and
# changing the master's `.docket-webawesome` changes them all at once.
#
# Rename this to `.docket-webawesome` and put a URL on the first line only if
# THIS project must differ from the others. That is an exception, not a step.
#
# Pro kit:
#   https://ka-p.webawesome.com/kit/YOUR_KIT_ID/webawesome@3.13.0
#
# Free CDN (non-Pro components only):
#   https://early.webawesome.com/webawesome@3.0.0-beta.6/dist
#
# The look — Docket, Mellow, Playful, Classic — is not set here. It is the
# reader's choice, picked in the navigation rail or the viewer's sidebar, and
# remembered per browser.
